[ext_resource type="Shader" path="res://assets/shaders/outline.gdshader" id="3_outline"]

; The chest's parts are authored here rather than built in _ready(). Body, the
; four corner straps, the hinged Lid and InteriorGlow are all inspector-
; editable; treasure_chest.gd only animates them (the lid swings on Lid's own
; rotation:x, so the hinge is Lid's position - back edge of the body).
;
; The coin shower and the radial flash stay in code: both are transient, are
; spawned in numbers and are tweened away, so there is nothing to author.

